sequenceDiagram
    participant Ledger as Ledger line / transaction
    participant Engine as Decimal rules engine
    participant Prompt as Prompt context
    participant Model as LLM draft
    participant Reviewer as Accountant reviewer

    Ledger->>Engine: Account code, amount, date
    Engine->>Prompt: Material variance + source support
    Prompt->>Model: Constrained accounting facts
    Model->>Reviewer: Draft sentence / paragraph
    Reviewer->>Engine: Trace value back to source
    Reviewer->>Model: Accept or request edit
